  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7801.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7801.02 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to regular firefighters and municipal fire departments who pay for medical examinations conducted on or after July 17, 2019.\n\nSource. #13161, eff 1-21-21",
